flowchart TD
    Rep[Representative question or confirmation] --> Identity[Entra ID and tenant Functions ingress]
    Identity --> Scope[Validate JWT and authorise tenant and member]
    Scope --> Policy[Scoped session lease and budget checks]
    Policy -->|Read question| Model[Model receives minimised routing features]
    Model --> Read[Mandatory gateway validates the read tool]
    Read --> Evidence[Tenant Blob KB or scoped plan and directory APIs]
    Evidence --> Projection[Ownership and provenance checks then minimum projection]
    Projection --> Answer[Cited answer with deterministic calculations and cache age]
    Policy -->|Filing request| Draft[Gateway creates or resumes the scoped Cosmos draft]
    Draft --> Confirm{Rep confirms exact member agreed summary}
    Confirm -->|Wait| Draft
    Confirm -->|Cancel| Cancel[Mark draft CANCELLED without POST]
    Confirm -->|Yes| Approval[Gateway validates approval digest scope and lease]
    Approval --> Ledger[Cosmos ETag batch persists IN_FLIGHT and outbox event]
    Policy -->|Resume IN_FLIGHT| Approval
    Ledger --> Submit[POST grievance with the same key and exact bytes]
    Submit -->|503 or lost acknowledgement| Approval
    Submit -->|Acknowledgement| Complete[Persist COMPLETED and the original result]
    Answer --> Reply[Representative response and scoped continuation]
    Complete --> Reply
    Cancel --> Reply
    Policy -. Safe step events .-> Outbox[Tenant Cosmos audit outbox]
    Read -.-> Outbox
    Draft -.-> Outbox
    Ledger -.-> Outbox
    Complete -.-> Outbox
    Outbox --> Export[Checkpointed exporter]
    Export --> Audit[Tenant Blob store with locked six year retention]
